beyondthestars.gui.eye.info.next.5=T5: the neutron star's milestones, the Subspace Cooling Core, the First Cooling
beyondthestars.gui.eye.info.next.6=T6: Sirius B's milestones, the Magnetar Seed Core, the Magnetar Merger
